    <div class="post-hero">
      <div class="hero-tag">🧠 Behavioural Science · Psychology · 2026</div>
      <h1>
        Why Random Decisions <em>Feel Fair</em> — The Psychology of
        <em>Letting Chance Choose</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        A coin flip and a careful debate can land on the same restaurant, the
        same task, the same winner — yet one leaves you shrugging and the other
        leaves you second-guessing. Here's the psychology behind that gap, and
        when it actually pays to hand a decision to chance.
      </p>
      <div class="post-meta">
        <span>⏱ 9 min read</span><span class="meta-dot">·</span>
        <span>📂 Behavioural Science</span>
      </div>
