            <div class="cc-num">Classrooms</div>
            <h3>Calling on Students</h3>
            <p>
              When a random wheel picks who answers, students stop reading the
              choice as a comment on how the teacher sees them.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="concept-card">
            <div class="cc-emoji">💼</div>
            <div class="cc-num">Workplaces</div>
            <h3>Assigning Tasks</h3>
            <p>
              Manager-picked assignments quietly breed resentment over who gets
              the good projects. A visibly random pick removes that target
              entirely.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="concept-card">
            <div class="cc-emoji">🎁</div>
            <div class="cc-num">Giveaways</div>
            <h3>Picking a Winner</h3>
